Drek
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Derrick | Official Website</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #101020;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
    }

    header {
      padding: 20px;
      background: #191932;
      color: #bd9aff;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 70px 15px;
      background: linear-gradient(140deg, #30205f, #101020);
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 45px;
    }

    h1 span {
      color: #bd9aff;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #dedbea;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      margin: 20px;
      padding: 15px 25px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      background: #a77bff;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    section {
      padding: 35px 20px;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    h2 {
      color: #bd9aff;
    }

    footer {
      background: #191932;
      padding: 25px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <h2>DERRICK</h2>
    <p>Official Creator Website 🇺🇬</p>
  </header>

  <div class="hero">
    <h1>Hi, I'm <span>Derrick</span></h1>
    <p>@nicy.drek</p>
    <p>Dancer | TikTok Content Creator | Uganda</p>
    <a class="button"
       href="https://www.tiktok.com/@nicy.drek">
       Follow Me on TikTok
    </a>
  </div>

  <section>
    <h2>About Me</h2>
    <p>
      My name is Derrick, also known as @nicy.drek.
      I am a TikTok content creator from Uganda
      with a passion for dancing and creativity.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>My Story</h2>
    <p>
      Dancing is my passion. Through TikTok,
      I share my creativity and express myself.
      I dream of becoming a famous content creator
      and reaching people around the world.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>My Dream</h2>
    <p>
      My goal is to grow my audience, improve
      my content and become a recognised
      content creator.
    </p>
    <a class="button"
       href="https://www.tiktok.com/@nicy.drek">
       Visit My TikTok
    </a>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 Derrick | @nicy.drek</p>
    <p>Made with passion in Uganda 🇺🇬</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
